        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Pierre-Joseph Proudhon, George Valois, Georges Sorel, Olivier Ferrand\n- Organizations: French National Assembly, Cercle Proudhon\n\nFacts:\n- Pierre-Joseph Proudhon was the author of *What Is Property?*.\n- Pierre-Joseph Proudhon was a member of the French National Assembly.\n- George Valois and Georges Sorel founded the Cercle Proudhon.\n- The Cercle Proudhon was inspired by Pierre-Joseph Proudhon.\n- Olivier Ferrand was elected to the French National Assembly.",
